CM_ BO_ 2365524207 "CAN0 only. Extended ID 0x0CFF08EF, 10 ms motor command.";
CM_ BO_ 2365524463 "CAN0 only. Extended ID 0x0CFF09EF, 100 ms motor parameter command.";
CM_ BO_ 17 "Bench CAN0 standard ID 0x011 is assigned to IPC_Tx_Msg1. ESP_T_01 uses the same ID in the supplier DBC and therefore cannot coexist on this bus.";
CM_ BO_ 1026 "SBW2001 authoritative layout: byte0 mode, bytes1-2 command counter, bytes3-4 received angle, bytes5-6 actual angle, byte7 send counter.";
CM_ BO_ 1952 "Bench CAN0 only. Set Dbg_Unlock to 0x5AA5 (23205). Send cyclically at 100 ms. Overrides automatically expire after 500 ms.";
CM_ BO_ 1953 "Bench CAN0 only. Values are encoded as the raw ADC counts expected by the current model, with DBC scaling displayed in volts.";
CM_ BO_ 1954 "Bench CAN0 only. Air pressure is displayed as final MPa; wheel inputs are sensor frequencies in Hz.";
CM_ BO_ 1955 "Bench CAN0 only. HIN1-HIN8 map directly to the eight digital inputs used by the current model.";
CM_ BO_ 1968 "Bench CAN0 VCU debug status. LOX bits 0..4 are Brake, ASSI-B, ASSI-Y, EBS error and RES error. HOX bits 0..6 are EBS trigger, BMS, IMD, DI8, RUN, R2D buzzer and Emergency buzzer.";
CM_ BO_ 186 "Bench CAN0 VCU output, ID 0x0BA, JY60 acceleration and temperature, 500 ms.";
CM_ BO_ 187 "Bench CAN0 VCU output, ID 0x0BB, JY60 angular velocity, 500 ms.";
CM_ BO_ 188 "Bench CAN0 VCU output, ID 0x0BC, JY60 attitude angle, 500 ms.";
CM_ SG_ 484 res_xorcheck "Byte2 must equal Byte0 XOR Byte1.";
CM_ SG_ 1952 Dbg_Unlock "Required value: 0x5AA5 (23205 decimal).";
CM_ SG_ 1952 Dbg_MasterEnable "Master safety gate. Set to 1 only for bench testing.";
CM_ SG_ 1954 Dbg_AirPressure1 "0 to 1 MPa sensor, physical 0 to 10 V, sampled by MCU AIN4 0 to 10 V input.";
CM_ SG_ 1954 Dbg_AirPressure2 "0 to 1 MPa sensor, physical 0 to 10 V, sampled by MCU AIN5 0 to 10 V input.";

